{"id":"n57273-1-7","stage":1,"title":"옛날 · 古","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57273-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 저 사람들은 나무로 뭐 하는 거예요?","zh":"妈妈，那些人用木头在做什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들은","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나무로","meaning":"木材，木头","explanation":"나무：木材，木头；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"2","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b294b251f77dfbc5","term":"나무","zh":"木材，木头","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3","entryId":"32750","definition":"用于建房或制作家具的材料。","pronunciation":["나무"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ba287e9c65cc8adf360.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57273-1-7-2","ko":"아주 먼 옛날에는 저렇게 불을 피웠단다.","zh":"很久很久以前，人们就是那样生火的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먼","meaning":"久，久远","explanation":"멀다：久，久远；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"멀다","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26833","senseId":"2","lemma":"멀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옛날에는","meaning":"古，古代","explanation":"옛날：古，古代；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"옛날","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57273","senseId":"1","lemma":"옛날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불을","meaning":"火","explanation":"불：火；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"1","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"피웠단다.","meaning":"点燃；表示引用。","explanation":"피우다：点燃；하다：表示引用。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"피우다","audio":"/audio/6e1ba3221dbae36d0573.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73272","senseId":"2","lemma":"피우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"e6d01e903c854714","term":"멀다","zh":"久，久远","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3","entryId":"26833","definition":"时间间隔长。","pronunciation":["멀ː다"]},{"id":"336963582ab921f0","term":"옛날","zh":"古，古代","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3","entryId":"57273","definition":"年代久远的往日。","pronunciation":["옌ː날"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"物质散发着光和热而燃烧。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"6e1ba3221dbae36d","term":"피우다","zh":"点燃","audio":"/audio/6e1ba3221dbae36d0573.mp3","entryId":"73272","definition":"把火点上使之燃烧。","pronunciation":["피우다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fb26f3ddb91c1e75eb44.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57273","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9644,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，那些人用木头在做什么呀？","很久很久以前，人们就是那样生火的。","你怎么把眼睛瞪得那么圆？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，那些人用木头在做什么呀？","很久很久以前，人们就是那样生火的。","你怎么把眼睛瞪得那么圆？"],"answer":1}]}
